OL,3,ALula and Bolsonaro locked in knife-edge
OL,4,ABrazil election with most votes counted
OL,5,
OL,6,FVotes are being counted to decide
OL,7,FBrazil's next president - here's a
OL,8,Freminder of the basics
OL,10,FRight-wing senator Flavio Bolsonaro -
OL,11,Fwho won the first round earlier this
OL,12,Fmonth - is facing incumbent President
OL,13,FLula da Silva
OL,15,FWith more than half of the votes
OL,16,Fcounted, the two candidates are
OL,17,Fvirtually tied
